<title>MALAYSIA: Hua Joo Seng '96 net at 17.51 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Hua Joo Seng '96 net at 17.51 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  17.51   vs	   5.71</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 53.14   vs	  23.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		   226.47   vs	   0.1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    33.49   vs	   8.77</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  4.77   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	   0.3</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 5.0    vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Hua Joo Seng Enterprise Bhd makes and trades in paints and related products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
